/span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-smalltext mui-style-59asat" aria-label=".99&lt;span&gt; for 1st mo. &lt;br&gt;+ taxes &amp; fees&lt;/span&gt;">.99<span> for 1st mo. <br/>+ taxes &amp; fees</span></span></div></div><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-root MuiButton-text MuiButton-textPrimary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-textSizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary mui-style-mlrzze" tabindex="0" href="/packages" aria-label="shop now streaming packages" data-linkPosition="panel_product cards" data-linkDestination="/packages"><span>Shop now</span></a></div><div class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-Labelsmall mui-style-1il34l" id="entertainment-front-legalText"><b>($59.99/mo. w/ req’d fees for 1st mo.)</b> Price reflects $30 off for 1st mo. Cancel anytime.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-style-8q67tb" tabindex="0" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Compare Streaming packages"><span class="compare-icon-wrapper MuiBox-root mui-style-1b3quqv"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10.0002 1.66666C8.35199 1.66666 6.74059 2.1554 5.37018 3.07108C3.99977 3.98675 2.93179 5.28825 2.30106 6.81097C1.67033 8.33369 1.50534 10.0092 1.82688 11.6257C2.14843 13.2423 2.94199 14.7271 4.10743 15.8925C5.27287 17.058 6.75769 17.8517 8.37419 18.1732C9.9907 18.4948 11.6665 18.3297 13.1892 17.699C14.7119 17.0683 16.0132 16.0002 16.9289 14.6297C17.8446 13.2593 18.3335 11.6482 18.3335 9.99999C18.3335 7.78985 17.4554 5.67024 15.8926 4.10744C14.3298 2.54463 12.2103 1.66666 10.0002 1.66666Z" fill="#DFE7F2"></path></svg></span><span class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-smalltextmedium mui-style-1b2027i" background="#FAFCFF" selectedColor="#0062DB">Compare</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="dtv2-inpagele